  "goodToKnow": "Hinrichten means to execute, to carry out a death sentence. Die Hinrichtung is an execution. Article 102 of the Grundgesetz (1949) states Die Todesstrafe ist abgeschafft; the GDR abolished it in 1987. The members of the White Rose resistance group, including Sophie and Hans Scholl, were executed in Munich in 1943. Separable: richtete hin, hingerichtet. Don't confuse it with einrichten (to furnish)."
